{"id":"0a3b51c84f7bd9b0a7d665089f1a76f35cf79cb3","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/57996","title":"Claude独立破译370年前密文！仅44分钟，密码学家破防了 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"新智元\n                  2026-09-16 14:30 分享","excerpt":"独立研究员让Claude 5.1挑战17世纪英国学者托马斯·厄克特遗留370年的“双行密码”，全程无人干预。仅用44分钟、消耗17.6万Token，Claude成功破译该历史悬案，引发密码学界震动。这一突破表明大模型在复杂古典密码分析领域已具备自主推理与解密能力，远超传统工具局限，也对人类密码学权威构成挑战。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><h3 data-mpa-powered-by=\"yiban.io\"><section data-tools=\"135编辑器\" data-id=\"88402\" data-style=\"line-height: 1.8; text-align: justify; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0px; color: rgb(117, 114, 114);white-space: normal;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/12c576877ce1dad88ae9ff2e8f898a661789540201212.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.42643923240938164\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"2345\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505242196\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/12c576877ce1dad88ae9ff2e8f898a661789540201212.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section></h3><h3><section data-id=\"88402\" data-tools=\"135编辑器\"><p><span><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">&#160;&#160;</span></span></strong><strong><span><span leaf=\"\">新智元报道 &#160;</span></span></strong></span></p></section></h3><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">人类密码学界，要破防了？</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">就在最近，独立研究员给Claude Fable 5.1抛出了一个纯开放式命题——</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">破解一个封印了整整370年的历史悬案。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">它是由由17世纪英国学者Sir Thomas Urquhart留下的「双行密码」（Cyphral Distich）。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/befafaaadac38e379de4d06067bfc65e1789540201212.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7472222222222222\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-width=\"1180\" data-height=\"882\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"420\" data-imgfileid=\"505242184\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/befafaaadac38e379de4d06067bfc65e1789540201212.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">在耗时44分钟、消耗17.6万个Token，且人类全程零干预的情况下，Claude独自把谜题彻底给解了。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">让人大跌眼镜的是，在摸清规律后，它顺藤摸瓜，把作者另一本著作中沉睡了370多年、篇幅更长、多达285个数字的「八行密码」（Cyphral Octastich）也一并破解。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">几个世纪以来，无数专业学者与业余极客前赴后继碰壁的谜题，就这么被AI「顺手连破两题」。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0be9ccc1ffbae7511b31bcf4d3d873f21789540201212.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1448\" data-width=\"1448\" data-height=\"1086\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"422\" data-imgfileid=\"505242193\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0be9ccc1ffbae7511b31bcf4d3d873f21789540201212.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789540201213.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789540201213.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">370年前谜题，密码学家碰壁</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">双行密码，出自Urquhart 1653年的论著《Logopandecteision》卷末。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">整段密文，只由两行各32个数字组成，共64个数字。</span></span></p><section><p><span leaf=\"\">5.3.27.38.32.14.21.8.66.8.70.39.5.9.12.18.2.3.56.5.1.7.3.2.13.19.3.25.9.3.16.6. 25.15.13.6.11.20.5.1.2.12.1.20.20.49.20.20.35.33.4.6.8.35.5.33.5.5.18.10.3.11.32.42.</span></p></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">数字下面配了一首短诗，大意是：诚实而有本事的读者，能在这两行里读到「他自己心中所愿，和作者的心思」。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">过去几个世纪里，无论是在1899年的《Notes and Queries》、20世纪的专业密码学专著，还是「全球五十大未解密文」榜单中，它都赫赫在列。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">无数解密高手前赴后继，掏出了词频分析、单表替换、同音替换等一整套看家本领，结果全部碰壁。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7995454f3f258c76accaa71e88cf79601789540201213.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.3068493150684932\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"365\" data-width=\"365\" data-height=\"477\" data-imgfileid=\"505242182\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7995454f3f258c76accaa71e88cf79601789540201213.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789540201214.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789540201214.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">Claude 44分钟破解</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">钥匙就藏在书里</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">密码学者们长期默认这串数字对应着某种外部密表，但实际上，「钥匙」就印在书本里。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">破解过程中，Fable 5.1 抓住了两个关键破绽。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">密文紧跟在Urquhart书写的「32篇请愿书」之后，作者甚至特意强调过「没有什么数字能比32更合适」。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/aeeef22cb2b085fe26339d96f8685cd61789540201215.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.21944444444444444\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-width=\"1438\" data-height=\"316\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"123\" data-imgfileid=\"505242183\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/aeeef22cb2b085fe26339d96f8685cd61789540201215.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">其次，密文配诗明示诚实的读者会在其中读到「心之所愿与作者所思」。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">而正文中这32篇请愿书的结尾，恰恰反复出现「愿望」（wish/desire）这类词。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">把两点结合起来，解密规则简单得令人惊叹：密文第i个数字，就是翻到第i篇请愿书，找到对应序号的单词并提取首字母</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">按照这个规则，明文瞬间浮出水面：</span></span></p><section><p><span leaf=\"\">第一行：O GOD UPHOLD KING CHARLS THE SECOND AND&#160;</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">第二行：MAKE HIM THE SUPREME RULER OF THIS LAND</span></p></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">两行明文每行正好32个字母，且末尾押韵（and/land），完全契合「双行押韵诗」的格式。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Urquhart作为一名忠诚的保皇党人，在文字里埋下为查理二世祈福的暗语，从历史背景看也完全合理。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e6cdf525bf88495082334db9a79d9c891789540201215.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5615696887686062\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"739\" data-width=\"739\" data-height=\"415\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"316\" data-imgfileid=\"505242185\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e6cdf525bf88495082334db9a79d9c891789540201215.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789540201215.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.25\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"292\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"505100592\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/779d8ee2aa3c7221f0c1e639f63215ab1789540201215.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></strong></p></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">顺手连破第二题</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">尝到甜头后，Claude沿着这套「书本即坐标」的模型逻辑，直接转向另一部著作《The Jewel》中留下的「八行密码」。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">那道谜题包含整整285个数字，复杂度陡增。Claude迅速核验出：该书恰好有284个编号页。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">它如法炮制，将第&#160;</span></span><span data-meta-block-props=\"{&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;2aeff7a9-f0c9-4dc9-8dbc-bfb5918f99df&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;EQUATION_BLOCK&quot;,&quot;initData&quot;:{},&quot;props&quot;:{&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;equation&quot;:&quot;k&quot;},&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;viewType&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;}}\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">$$$$</span></span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">&#160;个数字映射为第&#160;</span></span><span data-meta-block-props=\"{&quot;blockId&quot;:&quot;a904c940-439a-4039-b551-d4ebf9f6660b&quot;,&quot;blockType&quot;:&quot;EQUATION_BLOCK&quot;,&quot;initData&quot;:{},&quot;props&quot;:{&quot;data&quot;:{&quot;equation&quot;:&quot;k&quot;},&quot;displayMode&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;,&quot;viewType&quot;:&quot;inline&quot;}}\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">$$$$</span></span></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">&#160;页中指定位次的单词首字母。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">利用早期英语文献数据库（EEBO-TCP），模型仅靠自主编写的数段Python脚本进行版面校准与排版漂移修正，直接还原出了一首完整的抑扬格八行长诗：</span></span></p><section><pre data-lang=\"sql\"><code><span leaf=\"\">GREAT LORD, MANTAINE THAT REGAL FAMILIE</span></code><code><span leaf=\"\">WHEREOF KING CHARLS THE&#160;<span>SECOND</span>&#160;<span>IS</span>&#160;THE HEAD,</span></code><code><span leaf=\"\"><span>AND</span>&#160;<span>GRANT</span>&#160;THAT HE MAY BEARE THE SUPREME SWEIGH</span></code><code><span leaf=\"\"><span>WHERE</span>&#160;ENGLISH, SCOTS&#160;<span>AND</span>&#160;IRISH&#160;<span>ARE</span>&#160;BORNE&#160;<span>AND</span>&#160;BRED,</span></code><code><span leaf=\"\">...</span></code><code><span leaf=\"\">LET HIM BE OUR SOLE CESAR, ARTUR, HECTOR,</span></code><code><span leaf=\"\">OUR EMPEROUR, KING, MONARCH&#160;<span>AND</span>&#160;PROTECTOR.</span></code><code><span leaf=\"\">AMEN, SO BE IT.</span></code></pre></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789540201215.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5267857142857143\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"112\" data-imgfileid=\"505095291\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/df9d89c9b2ec34282d3fc8aa39faec001789540201215.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">AI只要44分钟，没有黑魔法</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">整个诱导测试的过程，其实并不复杂。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">测试者只是给了模型一个大方向，避开了万人死磕的超复杂死结，也避开了模棱两可、死无对证的模糊谜题。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Claude在检索中展现出了惊人的判断力——</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">它知道什么时候该放弃没有进展的死胡同，并在遇到这个可解性极高的问题时迅速锁定线索。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/98725b59d3f0d99bda8a648941ca2ddc1789540201215.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.3333333333333333\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1086\" data-width=\"1086\" data-height=\"1448\" data-backw=\"562\" data-backh=\"749\" data-imgfileid=\"505242192\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/98725b59d3f0d99bda8a648941ca2ddc1789540201215.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这恰好指向了一个更深层的判断，Claude开始系统性解决一类长期被人类忽略的问题：</span></span></p><section><p><span leaf=\"\">答案藏在海量旧资料里，只是过去没人有足够时间和耐心一直翻下去。</span></p></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">人类知识探索的瓶颈，正在从「智力不够」，变成「精力不够」。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">Vals AI对此的总结很直白，「人类需要手动搜索旧材料、长期测试多种解密方法，而 AI 可以快速迭代这些任务，这是巨大的优势」。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">这种能力，并非只体现在密码破解上。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">就在不久前，Anthropic披露其Agent已能自主提出假设、设计并跑完全部实验，补上了97%的性能缺口，而两名人类研究员忙活一周只补上23%。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">从实验室到古籍堆，AI正在接管那些「不是不够聪明，而是不够持久」的任务。</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">参考资料：</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://x.com/bcherny/status/2099322487603634395?s=20&#160;</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">https://arc.net/l/quote/xctymnvc</span></span></p><p><span><span leaf=\"\">编辑：桃子</span></span></p><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">秒追ASI</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">点赞、转发、在看一键三连</span></strong><strong><span leaf=\"\">⭐</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！</span></strong></span></section><p><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1789540201215.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"122\" data-imgfileid=\"505133683\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d80689a0a4e5d39176224ba829acc3e1789540201215.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01789540201215.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6129629629629629\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"355\" data-imgfileid=\"505229036\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/50d0834dc7435040000e52c792d62ad01789540201215.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/486d0628e0a5602d518991256ebf70691789540201215.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.4\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-backw=\"578\" data-backh=\"809\" data-imgfileid=\"505242176\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/486d0628e0a5602d518991256ebf70691789540201215.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></section></div></DIV>","content_text":"新智元报道 人类密码学界，要破防了？就在最近，独立研究员给Claude Fable 5.1抛出了一个纯开放式命题——破解一个封印了整整370年的历史悬案。它是由由17世纪英国学者Sir Thomas Urquhart留下的「双行密码」（Cyphral Distich）。在耗时44分钟、消耗17.6万个Token，且人类全程零干预的情况下，Claude独自把谜题彻底给解了。让人大跌眼镜的是，在摸清规律后，它顺藤摸瓜，把作者另一本著作中沉睡了370多年、篇幅更长、多达285个数字的「八行密码」（Cyphral Octastich）也一并破解。几个世纪以来，无数专业学者与业余极客前赴后继碰壁的谜题，就这么被AI「顺手连破两题」。370年前谜题，密码学家碰壁双行密码，出自Urquhart 1653年的论著《Logopandecteision》卷末。整段密文，只由两行各32个数字组成，共64个数字。5.3.27.38.32.14.21.8.66.8.70.39.5.9.12.18.2.3.56.5.1.7.3.2.13.19.3.25.9.3.16.6. 25.15.13.6.11.20.5.1.2.12.1.20.20.49.20.20.35.33.4.6.8.35.5.33.5.5.18.10.3.11.32.42.数字下面配了一首短诗，大意是：诚实而有本事的读者，能在这两行里读到「他自己心中所愿，和作者的心思」。过去几个世纪里，无论是在1899年的《Notes and Queries》、20世纪的专业密码学专著，还是「全球五十大未解密文」榜单中，它都赫赫在列。无数解密高手前赴后继，掏出了词频分析、单表替换、同音替换等一整套看家本领，结果全部碰壁。Claude 44分钟破解钥匙就藏在书里密码学者们长期默认这串数字对应着某种外部密表，但实际上，「钥匙」就印在书本里。破解过程中，Fable 5.1 抓住了两个关键破绽。密文紧跟在Urquhart书写的「32篇请愿书」之后，作者甚至特意强调过「没有什么数字能比32更合适」。其次，密文配诗明示诚实的读者会在其中读到「心之所愿与作者所思」。而正文中这32篇请愿书的结尾，恰恰反复出现「愿望」（wish/desire）这类词。把两点结合起来，解密规则简单得令人惊叹：密文第i个数字，就是翻到第i篇请愿书，找到对应序号的单词并提取首字母按照这个规则，明文瞬间浮出水面：第一行：O GOD UPHOLD KING CHARLS THE SECOND AND 第二行：MAKE HIM THE SUPREME RULER OF THIS LAND两行明文每行正好32个字母，且末尾押韵（and/land），完全契合「双行押韵诗」的格式。Urquhart作为一名忠诚的保皇党人，在文字里埋下为查理二世祈福的暗语，从历史背景看也完全合理。顺手连破第二题尝到甜头后，Claude沿着这套「书本即坐标」的模型逻辑，直接转向另一部著作《The Jewel》中留下的「八行密码」。那道谜题包含整整285个数字，复杂度陡增。Claude迅速核验出：该书恰好有284个编号页。它如法炮制，将第 $$$$ 个数字映射为第 $$$$ 页中指定位次的单词首字母。利用早期英语文献数据库（EEBO-TCP），模型仅靠自主编写的数段Python脚本进行版面校准与排版漂移修正，直接还原出了一首完整的抑扬格八行长诗：GREAT LORD, MANTAINE THAT REGAL FAMILIEWHEREOF KING CHARLS THE SECOND IS THE HEAD,AND GRANT THAT HE MAY BEARE THE SUPREME SWEIGHWHERE ENGLISH, SCOTS AND IRISH ARE BORNE AND BRED,...LET HIM BE OUR SOLE CESAR, ARTUR, HECTOR,OUR EMPEROUR, KING, MONARCH AND PROTECTOR.AMEN, SO BE IT.AI只要44分钟，没有黑魔法整个诱导测试的过程，其实并不复杂。测试者只是给了模型一个大方向，避开了万人死磕的超复杂死结，也避开了模棱两可、死无对证的模糊谜题。Claude在检索中展现出了惊人的判断力——它知道什么时候该放弃没有进展的死胡同，并在遇到这个可解性极高的问题时迅速锁定线索。这恰好指向了一个更深层的判断，Claude开始系统性解决一类长期被人类忽略的问题：答案藏在海量旧资料里，只是过去没人有足够时间和耐心一直翻下去。人类知识探索的瓶颈，正在从「智力不够」，变成「精力不够」。Vals AI对此的总结很直白，「人类需要手动搜索旧材料、长期测试多种解密方法，而 AI 可以快速迭代这些任务，这是巨大的优势」。这种能力，并非只体现在密码破解上。就在不久前，Anthropic披露其Agent已能自主提出假设、设计并跑完全部实验，补上了97%的性能缺口，而两名人类研究员忙活一周只补上23%。从实验室到古籍堆，AI正在接管那些「不是不够聪明，而是不够持久」的任务。参考资料：https://x.com/bcherny/status/2099322487603634395?s=20 https://arc.net/l/quote/xctymnvc编辑：桃子秒追ASI⭐点赞、转发、在看一键三连⭐点亮星标，锁定新智元极速推送！","fetched_at":"2026-09-17T04:17:36.364Z","ok":true}